title: Niko1
---
You found Niko again in the library, still reading the book he had picked.
His eyes were so focused he hadn't noticed you were there.

When he did, his amber eyes drifted to you as if you were an annoyance. You
almost scoffed at his audacity.

Closing the book with a bookmark, he turned toward you with a slow, almost
catlike motion, eyes fixed on you.

<<setBool NikoDiaImageState true>>
Niko: "Here for your answers, are you?"
<<setBool NikoDiaImageState false>>

He spoke lazily, raising an eyebrow as if questioning your presence.

-> Let's talk first
    <<incRelationship "Niko" 1>>
    <<jump LetsTalk>>
-> Yeah, give them to me
    <<jump Yeah>>
-> You don't have to act so mighty...
    <<decRelationship "Niko" 1>>
    <<jump DontHave>>
===

title: LetsTalk
---
He handed over the answers on yellow lined paper. Niko raised a brow, likely
wondering where this was coming from.

<<setBool NikoDiaImageState true>>
Niko: "I wasn't aware these questions came with small talk,"
<<setBool NikoDiaImageState false>>

His voice carried a slight snarl, as if disgusted at the idea of speaking
more with you.

The sudden hostility made you step back slightly in surprise. Irritation
quickly replaced it.

You: "You don't have to be rude about it,"

You glared at him, but he remained unfazed as you began reading his answers.

<<jump EndNiko1>>
===

title: Yeah
---
Niko rolled his eyes at your impatience before handing you the yellow paper.

<<jump EndNiko1>>
===

title: DontHave
---
Niko looked at you in disbelief, as if you'd just done something outrageous.
His hand subtly pulled back as disgust settled in his expression.

<<setBool NikoDiaImageState true>>
Niko: "Excuse me??"
<<setBool NikoDiaImageState false>>

He sounded baffled.

<<setBool NikoDiaImageState true>>
Niko: "Whatever, take your stupid answer,"
<<setBool NikoDiaImageState false>>

He shoved the paper toward you and began grumbling under his breath about
you being the rudest person he'd met.

<<jump EndNiko1>>
===

title: EndNiko1
---
You: "Thank you,"

Niko looked at you with an unreadable expression before dismissing you with
a wave. He reopened his book as if you were no longer there.

His attitude was unbelievable. You left with a quiet grumble, folding the
answers and tucking them into your folder.
===